msgid "Redirects"
msgstr "Redireksyon yo"

msgid "site"
msgstr "sit"

msgid "redirect from"
msgstr "redireksyon soti nan"

msgid ""
"This should be an absolute path, excluding the domain name. Example: “/"
"events/search/”."
msgstr ""
"Sa dwe yon chemen absoli, san non domèn nan. Egzanp: “/events/search/”."

msgid "redirect to"
msgstr "redireksyon ale nan"

msgid ""
"This can be either an absolute path (as above) or a full URL starting with a "
"scheme such as “https://”."
msgstr ""
"Sa ka swa yon chemen absoli (tankou pi wo a) oswa yon URL konplè ki kòmanse "
"ak yon sistèm tankou “https://”."

msgid "redirect"
msgstr "redireksyon"

msgid "redirects"
msgstr "redireksyon yo"
